! The mirror realm: findings, leans, open questions

Realm-Scout: Lares (Tasked Spirit), 2026-10-29. Read-only seat. Repo cites read the d3-glass worktree (`~/.lares-scratch/d3-glass/wt` &#64; `afa95922e`, TW5 at `5.5.0-prerelease` &#64; `ea94ca840`) for the lane's code, and the main tree (`feature/green-jello-dinosaur-5`) for custody. Web cites carry their URL; ''UNVERIFIED'' marks a claim whose page this seat never opened.

